%% Notification reachability (layer 2): handshake state of one notification target.
%% Index and code mapping: docs/dev/arch-assets.md
stateDiagram-v2
  direction LR
  state "challenge sent" as challenging
  [*] --> unverified: target bound
  unverified --> challenging: verify sends a ping with a code
  challenging --> verified: notification_ack with the code
  challenging --> failed: 5 minutes pass or the ping cannot be sent
  failed --> challenging: verify again
  verified --> unverified: route changed
  class unverified uncertain
  class challenging waiting
  class verified done
  class failed stopped
